# ===================================================================
# ADHD Budget Planner - Supabase Environment Configuration
# ===================================================================
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Navigate to: Project Settings > API
# 3. Copy your Project URL and anon public API key below
# 4. In local development or production, copy this file to .env
#    and update config.js or use the in-app "Connect Supabase" modal.
#
# IMPORTANT:
# - NEVER commit your service_role secret key to GitHub.
# - Only your public SUPABASE_ANON_KEY should be exposed to the client.
# ===================================================================

